#: scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1298d240233b4bc62cb95bea7d40d4446870a074ee068954397adee1ed915db8
#. default-sha256: 51644e73b56342332a041aaf61094464aaa5fd9de00c616595920a27df945b35
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Though she looked outwardly uncertain as Maria led her "
"forward, hand around her wrist, the White-Haired Girl seemed to be enjoying herself on the inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Anche se mostrava una certa insicurezza mentre Maria la "
"accompagnava tenendola per mano, dentro di sé la Ragazza dai⟪k:7⟫Capelli Bianchi si stava "
"divertendo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 856b5c5534183e8de6a9ece546b6a447b226b82b347f1945a0645bbc018789ed
#. default-sha256: 9fd17680a567caaaeb7f92e495c04cce3d49aad9f486e94f22339cccd943adfa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having spent her life without a single friend, she never dreamed the day would come when she "
"would find herself being dragged through the empty halls of a dark mansion by another woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avendo trascorso la vita senza alcun amico, non aveva mai immaginato che sarebbe giunto il "
"giorno in cui sarebbe stata trascinata da un’altra donna attraverso le sale vuote di una villa "
"buia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33686cd0973afb93adf3ab28e1fec04df68de7d72792dd94a6b27e98c4c65d8a
#. default-sha256: a3a07cb7787b5de223afb51e6010a0798818c75d82658b5e1b55153302c5fd96
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria’s presence seemed to shine a light upon the quiet corridor;⟪k:1⟫it would have been a "
"very lonely trek without her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La sola presenza di Maria bastava a gettare luce sul corridoio silenzioso;⟪k:1⟫ sarebbe "
"stato molto solitario senza di lei."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49cb7339bfb255cb4a18d6b084e4e9d768ad5025eae6d43d01b6b882bd7f1050
#. default-sha256: e90f5c843af7a9a7a91d593a8505a4c2812b3891a67b0e3c110c3bba3351696e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria spun around, gave an impish smirk, and raised her pointer finger to her lips with a "
"soft “shhh.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria si voltò, fece un sorrisetto malizioso e si portò l’indice sulle labbra, sussurrando "
"un leggero “shhh”."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73e2827c0fb9b533e08047245716017a29552a9e43bb79188154056804da6a7c
#. default-sha256: ba078ca00bbdce62e40345311acf6dd6126a9ce92b3cc408f04f6adc285c9110
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of it caused the White-Haired Girl to chuckle quietly.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The two of them, "
"on their way to their secret, private ball,⟪k:3⟫were like two adolescent girls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi rispose con una risatina contenuta.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le due "
"sembravano delle adolescenti, mentre si dirigevano al loro ballo privato.⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26ade05b91af185c050d97d159161bb14585f3801fb9f1ea52b13a67a07b137d
#. default-sha256: ba9e7f23105544ca0866e5af3c992745f66bc17a49bcd4ec04f77118fcb9ea8f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In short order, they arrived at the great hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Poco dopo, arrivarono al salone."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97b152ba4ff152fe690a572228b9da21cfdc6511c550e235fb4b3cad3675ced4
#. default-sha256: 1d04e0ca236221ad2e4cdd6f9ac140f70fc65803d3fe398b4477e8c908e290fa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫M-⟪k:10⟫My heart was pounding all the way "
"here..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Ahh...⟪k:10⟫ il cuore mi sta battendo "
"fortissimo..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52f5e888039550a4bb08fa4b2aae63baf652d73f822cd862a2346703b609f5d9
#. default-sha256: 46c1679fab0901a129a5d64a9893df971db254b862cc62c48be50ce544a3693b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s there to be nervous about?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s not like you’re breaking any rules."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Che c’è da essere nervosi?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mica stai infrangendo qualche regola."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4555530546f61f306ae7b9f703185d43e2bb204e9a93ba2f751b07a82c6cb7ea
#. default-sha256: b3db3669548399dca3c7245a7f4af374dc9e11f3412cf6b1c20b521a3e36b936
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only kids get in trouble for staying up late!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Once you’ve grown up, you’re "
"responsible for yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Solo i bambini finiscono nei guai se rimangono svegli fino a tardi!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ma gli "
"adulti, sono responsabili di se stessi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21075109270fc6e51953b81d9d739f5cebea9c219d30d9e5bbe131cf3e0eb6c6
#. default-sha256: 855787de04dacb6b76562cee841d35b4ea2335e2a344052336183fa36d9f0fd1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d033c447516d9d2b3e9c7573042a03bb3589568821379ca2ae98b1e05cad9377
#. default-sha256: 42dfedddde753ea47431b7ab3775ffd31ced7cf223dc914bee8ed5c2f5c0ce19
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will say, though, that it seems rather odd for two women to dance together."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Però ammetto che sembra piuttosto strano che due donne ballino assieme."

#: scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70d417c8c683c7044ee2073eaad9c4243b47cb8bb2b2c517d833c878e3188e87
#. default-sha256: b069d3d6d30fe95d234c755a65286dc74696bd170971d5e4cbb5c3c097116e0f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? If you’re having a good time, what does it matter what’s between your legs? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Where I come from, there’re dances where families lock arms in a big ring and go ’round in "
"circles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se ti stai divertendo, chi se ne frega di cosa hai in mezzo alle gambe?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Da "
"dove vengo io, ci sono balli in cui intere famiglie congiungono le braccia formando un grande "
"anello e continuano a girare in cerchio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ee33336ea32ad93f61933f94d0a4fe156f435b35ec9f101033a6bd6b5e124d1
#. default-sha256: aaa2f5032f65dc61b9f3c148f778e394b0308fb5e87e9cee007ef83c21f9ad09
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So who says two girls can’t have some fun together?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quindi chi lo dice che due ragazze non possono divertirsi?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58b516d3d8ae7d04e1c8ecf5ee5e901745ae1ead50c8044b5421ce047109d5de
#. default-sha256: 04ef184469ee1bee69a18068b9fed3c94e7e261bcc0ae7b04ba38513ca1d91ee
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I imagine you had many good moments with your family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Immagino che tu abbia passato dei bei momenti con la tua famiglia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8d22ce6eea13789d36cbd08adf6be1fb6a29892e95273b8178966a95eee71b7
#. default-sha256: 11d9dbf7c301801b795117a13c7e831864bd7afead335503aba02f3de6e949ea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well... ⟪k:2⟫I don’t have a family anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Beh... ⟪k:2⟫io non ho più una famiglia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8402e2f5cb3540fea670e256ca9e6e1da1a00b2909e57c70a09b86f4473042aa
#. default-sha256: 29882ea4f33c15dbbaea49da5809aa881ba9054e32461d34091dc8c62bc4b868
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Cosa...?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 926931f2fa984ff667208aa03349a7a57ef1545172f1403566090addeb82702d
#. default-sha256: 2f0c55ef04c187635353638aa7212e8e5bba18fcd7633dbb07f37bfd8b9c13ab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right, so I’ll show you how it’s done.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Watch carefully, ’cause you’re up "
"next!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫D’accordo, ti mostro come si fa.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Osserva attentamente, perché dopo tocca a te!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a71ad8fd9284426e65ab56db940da2e80fec3a2c5a4004372bfad45dada6eabd
#. default-sha256: 78935a8b97926dfe3f562ee722e212af4ac2a2ac7973dbfa4da7068c75e5bdd5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah... ⟪k:2⟫o-⟪k:3⟫okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah... ⟪k:2⟫v-⟪k:3⟫va bene."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b0a353589f50b3fb7e5499c71014185b5b28ba83730b2b7383b7972e248fbf4
#. default-sha256: 40cb6d4e81c398b83316616319de682ed632afc69b27f9d89b377441e3df449c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With a wide grin on her face, Maria began whistling softly and prancing "
"across the floor with an energetic rhythm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Con un enorme sorriso sulle labbra, Maria cominciò a canticchiare⟪k:4⟫a bassa "
"voce, saltellando da una parte all’altra con ritmo energico."

#: scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30e20071e183ec2ff5f67e83638951a0c21bf7d20e389fd0066d362d5b71b22f
#. default-sha256: 3ca29931e0dc5eb23e1e6c1998f252affa9f82aa1a01e4da6891d3a1f65da3b4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not the kind of complicated dance you’d see at fancy parties."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non era il genere di ballo complicato che si vede durante le feste di lusso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be16610e11663c1e4e523aa2d90fee76664ef9c0cf2d1e96b261cf637bbdd15f
#. default-sha256: 83d00c09d35d12704b7f213dd19b40caf2d234f865cd8377eae9f39a975b2d4f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The motions were simple, flowing, unembellished—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a folk dance, I suppose you "
"might call it.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫She seemed to be improvising a little bit as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I movimenti erano semplici, fluidi, senza abbellimenti—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫una danza "
"folcloristica... ⟪k:4⟫credo la si possa chiamare così.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Sembrava che ci stesse mettendo "
"del proprio, improvvisando⟪k:7⟫qualche passo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a9e84cc14d25675d533775f508941e41ad3facecbdef0400719a2730e2a71b7
#. default-sha256: e5e0bdc3825cbf5161d10839006eefeb71ab6b7cdddb6cea9dec210c47fa258d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But in any event, the White-Haired Girl was captivated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma in ogni caso, la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi era affascinata."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 998d4a3ca5e63eea02172e2c72c49de3db5653c0287b89fec12ae2378c243dc0
#. default-sha256: f89b744216130d031c8aa2a60046f16a19074d712e1d63fc99f95990535ea814
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being a sequence of steps anyone could replicate,⟪k:1⟫Maria breathed life into "
"the dance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonostante fosse una sequenza di passi che chiunque avrebbe potuto replicare, Maria stava "
"mettendo tutta la propria energia in quella danza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 535d7f62e21c7d4681520b2e7ffc339c4ecf2c1a5c0f42350c1a89ac3ae08bfd
#. default-sha256: ad3241d6aef9849216eab9ab0fb0f13f245cdd5c1b14380c8b41eb66ca4de8fa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was neither as lithe as an acrobat nor as light on her feet as a professional dancer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non era né agile come un acrobata, né leggera come una ballerina professionista."

#: scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fd65078c185d82c58081c9238a0d8b01086c9f7b641fabc845c4c1ea0ec948a
#. default-sha256: cf2c8980d5142c947e3112ac3e5f32d319efbd0102c4c532f5b918ca5ae50712
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was her own, lively, beautiful self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era se stessa, in tutta la sua bellezza e vitalità."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FA632136_9FDF_4C20_90D0_C3102E2C1DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1c2384e45f5dbd4ce8586f1920944924d77b362144783d6e346176fd0148988
#. default-sha256: 654935dfd9a7a4aa44768594c24cc66ba30fba224f967826ca0da00ac7cc9edb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FA632136_9FDF_4C20_90D0_C3102E2C1DA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria twirled in place, the skirt of her maid uniform billowing gently up around her. ⟪k:1⟫"
"With a smile, she extended her hand toward the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria volteggiò sul posto, con la gonna della sua uniforme da cameriera che si gonfiava "
"dolcemente intorno a lei.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sorridendo, tese le mani verso la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_36EB736A_E234_4CDF_B995_8753F0AC28D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d79f9cccfcd2112b43b1a570921ccf74f42e7c6f8275ba1ca29b9a4311fdfd30
#. default-sha256: 7545a9cde66c9c59c8d18d7f9e025d10d4967fd7038b4c7777566ae703207121
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_36EB736A_E234_4CDF_B995_8753F0AC28D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She hesitated for a moment, but as if being pulled forward by some invisible force, she took "
"Maria’s hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lei esitò per un momento, ma come se fosse esortata da una forza invisibile, prese la mano "
"di Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DCB77764_09BF_4F75_8804_A291D11383B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f30cb1772c6246803d164c096d4857e4e2f23293e9a4680dfe09e0f9449b3301
#. default-sha256: f0d962ca69eedc778f2aa9e27e9dd7b93fecdd30b6e3fbba9ebbc63fd92216e3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DCB77764_09BF_4F75_8804_A291D11383B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hand-in-hand, Maria ushered the White-Haired Girl into her dance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mano nella mano, Maria coinvolse la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi nella sua danza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_00E49622_54AE_41C1_A6DF_4391101C0ED5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b7183afc65b1a03326b23a0ae4525e3fe1e21651527ba3aa6bf3a537e1e0d51
#. default-sha256: d5978ae0ea3dcfc07d238043898358c8a2f55c56f1e46b3ab6293fcb2c357270
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_00E49622_54AE_41C1_A6DF_4391101C0ED5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was just the two of them, but you could almost see the crowd forming around them..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Erano solo loro due, ma si riusciva quasi a vedere la folla che le circondava..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_311AD7AE_688C_4BEA_97FF_A0B2E3E315FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82923fbce640aa23441feab42eb1a127b7852abe4d412c4a8a0a14295bd2a6b5
#. default-sha256: a77ff232c900f4cc6da80b81111bfb8174d75fdee339356ade6995edd1935751
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_311AD7AE_688C_4BEA_97FF_A0B2E3E315FB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the other people stepping up to join in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e altre persone che si univano per ballare."

#: scenario3:scenario3_153FE6BB_4F57_4B7C_BC7B_A0991FD49AAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fafdb7a16faf916bb81af8bbc0403393bd904effa93dda08eaa39ec8f20dd84
#. default-sha256: 0d80ba905a7c238ff2ac64287e5dda8e6fcbdea2e5a18cdb98649dea8d49a2f4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_153FE6BB_4F57_4B7C_BC7B_A0991FD49AAD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That’s it, Madam. Doin’ great!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Now lift your leg up, good, and spin like so."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sì, così, Madam. Vai alla grande!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ora solleva la gamba, bene, e falla ruotare in "
"questo modo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3DBBD0C0_88C4_4183_907D_F8AD8A80B9FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 893d06d5ae2d322faf8ce4de5e895ec0d5e8990733aa5705f6ae50f41dd122f3
#. default-sha256: 1c1d230c9f19ac8f2aee717ae321d7261dd34bf38391404b17b7b8a51a635a94
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3DBBD0C0_88C4_4183_907D_F8AD8A80B9FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Th-⟪k:1⟫This is not easy, Maria.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m having trouble following along..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫Non è facile, Maria.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Faccio difficoltà a seguirti..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABA7A7A3_2BD1_45C2_AE14_9D976B6B00F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d5fbd855328d6f2b47a241583a49afc77d1682d4e94bbdee1c3ff99862afd25
#. default-sha256: 1642b2388818ff699aec223582b18a3a31405d4d5e933a60342e45c8881078a6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABA7A7A3_2BD1_45C2_AE14_9D976B6B00F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You can do it!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Looking good so far!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’re a natural, Madam!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Puoi farcela!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Stai andando benone finora!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sei un talento naturale, Madam!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74103C2E_D0CD_4425_B338_E3C4B8B15E5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8789d66d536e80c93ce447c1a195ca363ecfc147ed206ad3cef23ec629b7ab5
#. default-sha256: 3e6d933d51899350dda8cc5eeb993c3d20b2a597d523d7dca9d2281f23679883
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74103C2E_D0CD_4425_B338_E3C4B8B15E5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, Maria...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I won’t fall for your flattery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oh, Maria...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non cadrò alle tue lusinghe."

#: scenario3:scenario3_595B9CE1_E64A_4CC0_A787_63066803C4CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e539eb6336215434109248fcde0623095ba2d8adcececda484b534a7ebfdd86
#. default-sha256: 614ea3b274883b8e4e9626eb9040e0060f0f383a683aef78bebcbe697038a36c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_595B9CE1_E64A_4CC0_A787_63066803C4CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I mean it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma lo penso davvero."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AF5831BE_12C1_44B1_98B0_CDC9025A6FA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31ad26d88b17dc4b7a0e3dbae1403db17727bc6e7805222421fadbd28e7cc217
#. default-sha256: c066288156eb38837d5be71f0d4d43ee511fee783876a4dd7325add7c74cc768
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AF5831BE_12C1_44B1_98B0_CDC9025A6FA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The whispers of the two girls.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Their muffled laughs.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Step, hop, step, step."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The rustling of fabric."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I sussuri delle due ragazze.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le loro risate soffocate.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Passo, salto, "
"passo, passo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Il fruscio dei vestiti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_72879ED8_1640_418B_8308_591CED4EF744
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9835c6d0b11ecc324f7ce0ed207b871dfe75c7d3bdb0317ddd17253fdf7c38fb
#. default-sha256: bde10efd0ffb45809ef302b67f4615695021cd3815e8454968be9ba05cddf3a3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72879ED8_1640_418B_8308_591CED4EF744"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Many different soft sounds layered atop one another, creating a little bubble of happiness "
"in the center of the hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Diversi suoni soffusi si sovrapponevano l’uno sopra l’altro,⟪k:1⟫creando una piccola bolla "
"di felicità al centro della sala."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE39CF84_5DCB_47C7_A6A2_5F1C6AB3E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c32060b66d8ebef5df681ae42c895ccc8e5f51e281b8057df0490b8d284a159e
#. default-sha256: d8b24678833dcd660d4c6af3051cfa292887cef2bdb0f269c97f3255ccf925f9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE39CF84_5DCB_47C7_A6A2_5F1C6AB3E8F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl’s movements were a great deal clumsier than Maria’s, but Maria would "
"never disparage her for that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I movimenti della Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi erano molto più goffi⟪k:1⟫di quelli di Maria, "
"ma la sua amica non l’avrebbe mai sminuita per questo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E4E99D2_C126_495A_BBC6_DD8367B68CD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0108d1d3524da2dce5c09212be2aa269edf63ee5cf9ff98a05f441412f483324
#. default-sha256: f17b88178aac1264b8e51eb4fa918d0814c4ebcf79a348f27eb0d88058c67ce4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5E4E99D2_C126_495A_BBC6_DD8367B68CD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On the contrary, she showered her with praise. ⟪k:1⟫As flustered as the White-Haired Girl "
"appeared, I imagine she was quite pleased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Al contrario, la riempiva di elogi.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per quanto apparisse agitata, immagino che la "
"Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi fosse alquanto soddisfatta."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F25A50BD_5B57_4304_9AE4_E0B21F00561E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9639b2f447f1ae465f4a028c28658d0af6628fdf70761160875e4a8060c74468
#. default-sha256: 91882ddc83db57e7e4630d32482acb026fc7df9ea8fea72de22443f619c1898e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F25A50BD_5B57_4304_9AE4_E0B21F00561E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Before long, the tightness in her face muscles loosened, a smile spread across her lips, and "
"she began to brighten up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In poco tempo, la tensione dei muscoli del suo viso si allentò;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫un sorriso si fece "
"largo sulle sue labbra, e iniziò a rallegrarsi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_492CA4CA_48E8_4150_946D_F4B39F9B207D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e5b3f13bd776be999f6d5f47ecc8004067bac116c9628376d4f6f313769e1bd
#. default-sha256: c248715a8a45fe9a89fb8bf90bfe72c6121f50ad15e7020ed4bfa7396f0b5336
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_492CA4CA_48E8_4150_946D_F4B39F9B207D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See?⟪k:1⟫What’d I tell ya?⟪k:2⟫Fun, huh?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Visto?⟪k:1⟫ Che ti dicevo?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫È⟪k:5⟫ uno spasso, vero?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EFF7A002_53EC_4B9F_B5AA_580D15A808BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88e89133efe1a02b95f8caabd0e0faf3056ccd352b1f65e6ce97e0b4290b653a
#. default-sha256: 7ce7988867d3dcb3151eb0cfbad809113050b0e3ab766dfbf66ee2efd1e0997f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EFF7A002_53EC_4B9F_B5AA_580D15A808BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Yes. I am quite surprised—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫both that I ⟪k:4⟫can⟪k:5⟫ dance and that I enjoy "
"doing it so much."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Già. Sono piuttosto sorpresa—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫sia perché ⟪k:4⟫riesco⟪k:5⟫ a ballare, sia "
"perché farlo mi diverte tantissimo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2D87F38D_28F3_4B87_8405_FCD8A13C39B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 036395c3877e28a2ad31fec94ce2045a3c4a393d92f68e22a3ebbdc246d52802
#. default-sha256: 173a1970bdacb8d19eacc1e6501a662d5ae57f6dca94b89e68d3f192665352ae
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2D87F38D_28F3_4B87_8405_FCD8A13C39B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hahah! Glad to hear it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hahah! Mi fa piacere sentirlo!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C4F380E4_755E_4CE7_BBD6_18E9B3510388
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16b2dd77205eef3fb512786e17c4f6de7ab9d8ddf12260993bf35806a7352345
#. default-sha256: 6e39f024d374f7fe5e3ca4b63a1c1caf992927fe85907a24d5864af420cf7f96
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C4F380E4_755E_4CE7_BBD6_18E9B3510388"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They exchanged looks and both laughed. ⟪k:1⟫That might have been the first time I had ever "
"seen the White-Haired Girl so delighted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si scambiavano occhiate, ridendo di gusto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Era la prima volta che vedevo quella "
"donna così felice."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FF8CF68_2DCB_4081_A2D6_4674035B5010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aad940bc19ecfc975196fd106047311b62349ef86da731228a82507ddf2ce802
#. default-sha256: 34ec9d0bfabc5915e0b3cd650b2734ad6777ebe649ae0a7e94c1483f28a47d9c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FF8CF68_2DCB_4081_A2D6_4674035B5010"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, because of her infirmity, she quickly found herself out of breath, her porcelain "
"skin flushed red."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, a causa della sua malattia, si ritrovò ben presto senza fiato,⟪k:1⟫e la sua pelle "
"di porcellana completamente arrossata."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A176BBA4_5C5B_4D0C_87E1_CAE5C1779EB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9cca3fed2c355ba4d8a99d229135caacae96f793985de982964d2551e58e6226
#. default-sha256: 21557452a6831acb801d3e963c0beecf5c8721fe553dde010e807dbd7fa0eb72
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A176BBA4_5C5B_4D0C_87E1_CAE5C1779EB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Maria immediately stopped for a break."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Maria si fermò immediatamente per una pausa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CBBB1F31_D4FC_46C4_9F32_5D62A4853939
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d66bf538f5db9923f7ee891084724b2efac274137f4933f42692b8c832d1b83
#. default-sha256: bb3d532d72758e55cd06f8cb60773ad190ff1a23a520701683a9584963ff6c44
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CBBB1F31_D4FC_46C4_9F32_5D62A4853939"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She could surely have continued dancing for some time yet, but Maria was conscientious of "
"the White-Haired Girl’s physical condition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avrebbe sicuramente continuato a ballare per molto altro tempo,⟪k:1⟫ma era consapevole delle "
"condizioni di salute della Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4BD5B9AC_1407_4118_9077_28D9615E3102
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3494c538bce56d04e11a24779a1dde69a5bc752700aa9edb451c71ace9071f65
#. default-sha256: ad6661d4fffa5fb6998b646fc268cb3bc561cd366db93dbe52330b79581d4b73
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4BD5B9AC_1407_4118_9077_28D9615E3102"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She looked over at Maria regretfully."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Questa guardò Maria con rammarico."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AA806ABD_A17D_4C0B_B0DC_407908E135F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4132d29ab162ad90574aab70d5de75600b341845ee1712d7bc860a526f11383e
#. default-sha256: fb954d9befd2dc0c66b7eef22b064348e647862914e25dca73198436accf55ed
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AA806ABD_A17D_4C0B_B0DC_407908E135F7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My apologies. If only I had more stamina...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I am "
"hardly a suitable partner for you, Maria."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Perdonami. Se solo avessi più resistenza...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Non "
"sono adatta a fare coppia con te, Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6A6F6A03_1B55_4CCC_BC45_D93B45B6135C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 436041937a238ab5a20d20c1feda5b9f5d84702ae505583b0c3714d2dbbed109
#. default-sha256: 00fb53a071605cad32a40a4c14d854da33d131ba08eb3bfe4e4c9db2bec28f5f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6A6F6A03_1B55_4CCC_BC45_D93B45B6135C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sure you are! ⟪k:2⟫This is all to cheer you up, Madam,⟪k:3⟫so as long as you’re having "
"fun, nothing else matters!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Certo che lo sei! ⟪k:2⟫Tutto questo serve a tirarti su, Madam,⟪k:3⟫quindi fintanto che "
"ti diverti, il resto non conta!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_016A6001_C3DB_41FA_86C0_32021741B8A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 714a2ac67d621f60f4f7138c8d6cd3388013ff35f19540c733d081773d5453c2
#. default-sha256: 2ae74291a774224845348f5dedd874f6e77a9d1409dd445729410c593ae06ac3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_016A6001_C3DB_41FA_86C0_32021741B8A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And heck, I’m enjoying myself plenty too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whaddya think, wouldn’t it be nice to do "
"this again sometime?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E caspita, mi sto divertendo un sacco anch’io.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Che ne pensi, non sarebbe bello se "
"lo rifacessimo qualche altra volta?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F218979F_B579_49C7_9FF9_A2F50ED63BA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96a9b3c038f9a5ffad159862a0ebceb5ae89e099a34f8da63ecece6ad3839bac
#. default-sha256: 7f5b8be454e3d3bfae462407532906bfd1e85e51793558c302122281cff85b16
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F218979F_B579_49C7_9FF9_A2F50ED63BA4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whenever you’re feeling down, let’s dance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ogni volta che ti senti giù di morale, veniamo qui a ballare."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A51D2C92_2001_4BA7_9EDD_D985CF66B96A
